# Meteofy

Read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) and [docs/architecture.md](../../docs/architecture.md) when starting non-trivial work.

- Monorepo: `apps/web` (JSX), `apps/api` (TS Express), `packages/shared` (`@meteofy/shared`).
- No Next.js, no Tailwind. Prefer existing styled-components themes and folder patterns.
- Web env: `apps/web/.env` (`VITE_*`). API env: `apps/api/.env`. Root `.env` is for optional MCP tools, not Vite.
- Lint must stay at zero warnings (`--max-warnings 0`).
- Do not add a test runner unless asked.
- Never commit secrets or invent API keys; do not bypass env/git hooks.
- Keep AI/product docs in sync with code changes (see `keep-docs-updated.mdc`).
